# Copy to live/.env (gitignored) and fill in. Never commit the real file.
#
# The private key of a wallet used ONLY for this: a fresh key holding nothing
# but the $50. Do not reuse a wallet that holds anything else.
POLYMARKET_PRIVATE_KEY=
# Optional. Leave empty to trade from the key's own Deposit Wallet, which the
# SDK creates on first use. Set it only to act for an existing Polymarket
# wallet that this key controls.
POLYMARKET_WALLET_ADDRESS=
